usage: python -m darkbot [-h] {doctor,paper,report,research} ...

DarkBot Phase-1 PAPER backend (spec 1.3.2). LIVE broadcast is technically
disabled.

positional arguments:
  {doctor,paper,report,research}
    doctor              config, free feed readiness, fee provenance, database
                        and PAPER boundary checks (D01-D06); secrets redacted
    paper               live PAPER with auto-recording and periodic status;
                        Ctrl-C stops controlled
    report              deterministic latency/PnL/quality reports
    research            pre-registered target/latency variants on the frozen
                        dataset; test split locked until policy freeze

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
